{"id":3092,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><div><p>为推进大学生心理健康教育，营造阳光向上的校园氛围，计算机科学与技术学院以“合作”为主题，于2026年5月27日组织全院师生积极参与学校心灵游园会活动。</p><p>活动紧扣“合作”内核，设置了多项趣味协作项目。在“同心筑景”拼图挑战中，2至4人组队，六分钟内完成70片拼图，同学们分工配合、高效协作，体会团队成就感。在“轨道运球”环节，四人两两牵绳搭建轨道，护送网球抵达终点，大家从生疏到默契，领悟信任与步调一致的重要性。现场还设有“团结buff”打卡区，欢声笑语不断。有同学表示：“这次活动让我感受到团队协作的乐趣，学会了高效配合。”</p><p>本次游园会将心理教育与团队实践相结合，帮助同学们舒缓压力、增强归属感。学院将持续开展多元化心理健康活动，护航学生健康成长。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Ynml4sM4NPUmlPM8RGiUm6VU8UPo7LiinzviU4lbLNLDnlL0gihFp2hmCIa0okybM1y8MYy8M4rVnRN8U47DnNl8oRnfU4MfMNQ2L4lbn7MFnNLanmNsMzQFLNVRLmvJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz-YLzLJqdDnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=12213&e=.png\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/89647475ED94C16FE484AC3A6FF359DC/FC0F9756/2AC27\" vheight=\"340.1300048828125\" vwidth=\"529.1300048828125\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Yo7C4PMRvsMR74n87QRLNr2UlWknz7isMz-8L8UZol-Zol-0gihFp2hmCIa0oShkM1hfnSh7M8lYLml4U4CZUNCsoRQfU4CDLlrkU4-Zn7rFLmGbUzQRoRnFozG8ozlJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz-YLzLJqdDnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=12213&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YLmf42MzTRo7Lbo8lWknRGbMRQ2UlVi7Ll7bM8-8nlU4LmL0gihFp2hmCIa0MYybnkhRokh2LRv8L4UsUNn2nR-bMzC8UNCDMz7YUlQ7L7WFLmU8MmnVo7nFLm7PMmNJqjfTQ4Oeo4xmvsU0qIbtpYyPLzG8g47YLm74gtA8pUDcc&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=12213&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/79DC8F074347BDFD29564BF6512AFD0B/24464E8D/21169\" vheight=\"340.1300048828125\" vwidth=\"529.1300048828125\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YLmf42MzTRo7Lbo8lWknRGbMRQ2UlVi7Ll7bM8-8nlU4LmL0gihFp2hmCIa0MYybnkhRokh2LRv8L4UsUNn2nR-bMzC8UNCDMz7YUlQ7L7WFLmU8MmnVo7nFLm7PMmNJqjfTQ4Oeo4xmvsU0qIbtpYyPLzG8g47YLm74gtA8pUDcc&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=12213&e=.jpeg\"></p></div></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://cst.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Ynml4sM4NPUmlPM8RGiUm6VU8UPo7LiinzviU4lbLNLDnlL0gihFp2hmCIa0okybM1y8MYy8M4rVnRN8U47DnNl8o